*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : SHP0001
*> PURPOSE : SHIPPING CHARGES RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 918
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0001.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY SHP0001C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 F-AM               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM PRICE-PARCEL
    DISPLAY "F-AM=" F-AM
    STOP RUN.
PRICE-PARCEL.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF CU-PW-KG <= 2
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CU-PW-KG <= 2
            MOVE 5 TO F-AM
        WHEN CU-PW-KG <= 20
            MOVE 12 TO F-AM
        WHEN OTHER
            COMPUTE F-AM = CU-PW-KG * 1.10
    END-EVALUATE.
